    "detailed_description": "Devil's Hideout is a fully-voiced horror point and click adventure. Lauren learns from a mystic that her young sister is still alive, with cultists staging her death. Traveling to the hospital where her sister received care, Lauren plunges headfirst into a nightmare.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754530/extras/cb783cc6582cbfa2fe4cbe7f7188f198.poster.avif?t=1746800106\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754530/extras/cb783cc6582cbfa2fe4cbe7f7188f198.webm?t=1746800106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>The world of Devil's Hideout is pure horror - narratively, aurally, and visually. Playing as Lauren, explore an abandoned hospital and a nearby town to find her young sister. Solve puzzles with the help of her friend Atticus, as you delve the insidious shadows of Devil's Hideout.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754530/extras/800dc53061613101d3c0c77da258e490.poster.avif?t=1746800106\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754530/extras/800dc53061613101d3c0c77da258e490.webm?t=1746800106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754530/extras/800dc53061613101d3c0c77da258e490.mp4?t=1746800106\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Game features</strong><br>\u2022 Immersive pixel art, saturated with horror.<br>\u2022 Fully voiced in English.<br>\u2022 Spine-chilling music and sound effects.<br>\u2022 Explore an abandoned town &amp; hospital.<br>\u2022 First-person perspective. <br>\u2022 Point and click puzzles &amp; item inventory. <br>\u2022 A tale of an older sister saving her younger sibling from evil.<br>\u2022 Devil cultists. <br>\u2022 Steam achievements!",
